<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="zh-Hans" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.160"><songwriters><songwriter>GAI</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata>
<amll:meta key="musicName" value="安安-Good Trip"/>
<amll:meta key="artists" value="GAI"/>
<amll:meta key="album" value="REAL G"/>
<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6769135105"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:52.790"><div begin="24.289" end="36.219" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="24.289" end="27.239" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.289" end="25.436">一月五号起得</span><span begin="25.436" end="25.798">早</span> <span begin="25.798" end="26.937">昨晚上睡得不</span><span begin="26.937" end="27.239">好</span></p><p begin="27.249" end="30.209" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.249" end="28.490">三十后经常这</span><span begin="28.490" end="28.612">样</span> <span begin="28.612" end="29.943">是不是要老的预</span><span begin="29.943" end="30.209">兆</span></p><p begin="30.319" end="33.209" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.319" end="31.454">送娃儿去了学</span><span begin="31.454" end="31.694">校</span> <span begin="31.846" end="32.957">我亲吻她的额</span><span begin="32.957" end="33.209">头</span></p><p begin="33.289" end="36.219" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.289" end="34.621">在群头发个消息</span> <span begin="34.621" end="35.405">看看今天</span><span begin="35.405" end="35.564">能</span><span begin="35.564" end="35.770">不能</span><span begin="35.770" end="35.919">约</span><span begin="35.919" end="36.219">球</span></p></div><div begin="36.229" end="47.946" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="36.229" end="39.269" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.229" end="37.282">时间在向前</span> <span begin="37.616" end="38.713">从没影响我的</span><span begin="38.713" end="39.017">判</span><span begin="39.017" end="39.269">断</span></p><p begin="39.279" end="42.240" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.279" end="40.274">北京很复杂</span> <span begin="40.668" end="41.719">但我却越活越</span><span begin="41.719" end="41.997">简</span><span begin="41.997" end="42.240">单</span></p><p begin="42.250" end="44.548" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.250" end="43.834">参加过的婚礼好多</span><span begin="43.834" end="44.357">都分了</span><span begin="44.357" end="44.548">家</span></p><p begin="44.558" end="46.093" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.558" end="44.793">I</span> <span begin="44.793" end="45.172">getting</span> <span begin="45.172" end="45.512">rich,</span> <span begin="45.512" end="45.717">too</span> <span begin="45.717" end="46.093">rich</span></p><p begin="46.103" end="47.946" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.103" end="46.220">我的</span><span begin="46.220" end="47.373">身边依旧还是</span><span begin="47.373" end="47.946">她</span></p></div><div begin="47.665" end="59.943" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="47.665" end="50.542" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.665" end="48.552">曾经一个</span><span begin="48.552" end="48.878">人</span><span begin="48.878" end="49.828">走到今天变</span><span begin="49.828" end="49.979">成了</span><span begin="49.979" end="50.432">三个</span><span begin="50.432" end="50.542">人</span></p><p begin="50.552" end="53.631" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.552" end="52.273">三个人不止买了三套</span><span begin="52.273" end="52.466">房</span> <span begin="52.466" end="53.357">留在了三座</span><span begin="53.357" end="53.631">城</span></p><p begin="53.781" end="56.801" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.781" end="54.881">我为我的出身</span><span begin="54.881" end="55.267">骄傲</span> <span begin="55.267" end="56.377">感谢老天给的</span><span begin="56.377" end="56.801">好运</span></p><p begin="56.941" end="59.943" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.941" end="58.296">感叹这一路艰险</span> <span begin="58.296" end="59.353">也有后怕过的</span><span begin="59.353" end="59.630">侥</span><span begin="59.630" end="59.943">幸</span></p></div><div begin="1:00.481" end="1:12.273" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:00.481" end="1:02.979" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.481" end="1:00.915">纷纷</span><span begin="1:00.915" end="1:01.439">扰扰</span> <span begin="1:01.439" end="1:02.412">又听到几声</span><span begin="1:02.412" end="1:02.979">狗叫</span></p><p begin="1:02.989" end="1:06.141" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.989" end="1:03.918">以前我好勇</span><span begin="1:03.918" end="1:04.454">斗狠</span> <span begin="1:04.454" end="1:05.423">现在我转身</span><span begin="1:05.423" end="1:05.735">走</span><span begin="1:05.735" end="1:06.141">掉</span></p><p begin="1:06.286" end="1:08.755" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.286" end="1:07.298">小弟娃儿告诉</span><span begin="1:07.298" end="1:07.668">你</span> <span begin="1:07.668" end="1:08.418">哥是过来</span><span begin="1:08.418" end="1:08.755">人</span></p><p begin="1:08.767" end="1:12.273" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.767" end="1:10.139">以你现在的咖位</span> <span begin="1:10.139" end="1:11.379">你根本不需要戴</span><span begin="1:11.379" end="1:11.739">口</span><span begin="1:11.739" end="1:12.273">罩</span></p></div><div begin="1:12.459" end="1:24.018" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:12.459" end="1:15.551" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.459" end="1:13.708">选择最早的航</span><span begin="1:13.708" end="1:14.027">班</span> <span begin="1:14.027" end="1:14.794">让我飞向</span><span begin="1:14.794" end="1:15.111">幸</span><span begin="1:15.111" end="1:15.551">福</span></p><p begin="1:15.753" end="1:18.481" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.753" end="1:15.908">我</span><span begin="1:15.908" end="1:16.702">太伟大了</span> <span begin="1:16.702" end="1:17.744">我是我自己的</span><span begin="1:17.744" end="1:18.158">信</span><span begin="1:18.158" end="1:18.481">徒</span></p><p begin="1:18.763" end="1:20.859" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.763" end="1:19.484">不奢望理</span><span begin="1:19.484" end="1:19.888">解</span> <span begin="1:19.888" end="1:20.390">不需要</span><span begin="1:20.390" end="1:20.859">解释</span></p><p begin="1:20.969" end="1:24.018" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.969" end="1:21.896">不再听哪个</span><span begin="1:21.896" end="1:22.149">安</span><span begin="1:22.149" end="1:22.472">排</span> <span begin="1:22.472" end="1:22.957">不需要</span><span begin="1:22.957" end="1:23.468">强行</span><span begin="1:23.468" end="1:23.664">理</span><span begin="1:23.664" end="1:24.018">智</span></p></div><div begin="1:24.807" end="1:48.323" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:24.807" end="1:27.136" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.807" end="1:25.651">阳光正在</span><span begin="1:25.651" end="1:26.393">照着</span><span begin="1:26.393" end="1:27.136">我</span></p><p begin="1:27.146" end="1:30.046" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.146" end="1:27.870">微风也在</span><span begin="1:27.870" end="1:28.646">吹着</span><span begin="1:28.646" end="1:30.046">我</span></p><p begin="1:30.862" end="1:32.776" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.862" end="1:31.658">难过的话</span><span begin="1:31.658" end="1:32.355">就别</span><span begin="1:32.355" end="1:32.776">说</span></p><p begin="1:32.786" end="1:36.557" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.786" end="1:33.150">因为</span><span begin="1:33.150" end="1:33.527">好</span><span begin="1:33.527" end="1:33.715">多</span><span begin="1:33.715" end="1:34.098">事</span><span begin="1:34.098" end="1:34.462">情</span><span begin="1:34.462" end="1:34.695">我</span><span begin="1:34.695" end="1:35.012">已</span><span begin="1:35.012" end="1:35.197">经</span><span begin="1:35.197" end="1:35.609">想</span><span begin="1:35.609" end="1:36.557">通</span></p><p begin="1:36.829" end="1:39.148" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.829" end="1:37.658">跨过高山</span><span begin="1:37.658" end="1:38.370">和湖</span><span begin="1:38.370" end="1:39.148">泊</span></p><p begin="1:39.158" end="1:41.135" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.158" end="1:39.925">早就预知</span><span begin="1:39.925" end="1:40.680">的结</span><span begin="1:40.680" end="1:41.135">果</span></p><p begin="1:41.355" end="1:43.960" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.355" end="1:41.924">因为你</span><span begin="1:41.924" end="1:42.537">在</span> <span begin="1:42.723" end="1:43.453">我才会勇</span><span begin="1:43.453" end="1:43.960">敢</span></p><p begin="1:44.130" end="1:48.323" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.130" end="1:44.932">才不留遗</span><span begin="1:44.932" end="1:46.516">憾</span> <span begin="1:46.516" end="1:47.261">安</span><span begin="1:47.261" end="1:48.323">安</span></p></div><div begin="2:11.783" end="2:23.588" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:11.783" end="2:14.606" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.783" end="2:13.229">还有两年四十岁</span><span begin="2:13.229" end="2:13.554">了</span> <span begin="2:13.554" end="2:13.877">我</span><span begin="2:13.877" end="2:14.286">你没</span><span begin="2:14.286" end="2:14.606">有</span></p><p begin="2:14.616" end="2:17.547" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.616" end="2:15.914">我在跟自己和解</span> <span begin="2:15.914" end="2:17.227">也更理解我的配</span><span begin="2:17.227" end="2:17.547">偶</span></p><p begin="2:17.787" end="2:20.607" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:17.787" end="2:18.924">连轴飞行好疲</span><span begin="2:18.924" end="2:19.220">惫</span> <span begin="2:19.220" end="2:20.409">情绪稳定少愚</span><span begin="2:20.409" end="2:20.607">昧</span></p><p begin="2:20.777" end="2:23.588" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.777" end="2:22.260">莫把手再背在后头</span> <span begin="2:22.260" end="2:23.400">看起真的老人</span><span begin="2:23.400" end="2:23.588">味</span></p></div><div begin="2:23.438" end="2:35.593" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:23.438" end="2:26.570" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.438" end="2:24.151">时间再</span><span begin="2:24.151" end="2:24.528">慢</span><span begin="2:24.528" end="2:24.870">点</span> <span begin="2:24.870" end="2:25.568">善待我的</span><span begin="2:25.568" end="2:26.021">父</span><span begin="2:26.021" end="2:26.570">母</span></p><p begin="2:26.580" end="2:29.515" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.580" end="2:27.157">如果你</span><span begin="2:27.157" end="2:28.645">过得不好 我会为你</span><span begin="2:28.645" end="2:28.941">祝</span><span begin="2:28.941" end="2:29.515">福</span></p><p begin="2:29.727" end="2:32.697" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.727" end="2:30.217">太阳</span><span begin="2:30.217" end="2:30.552">雨</span> <span begin="2:30.552" end="2:30.911">乌云</span><span begin="2:30.911" end="2:31.246">低</span> <span begin="2:31.246" end="2:32.403">张开翅膀拼命</span><span begin="2:32.403" end="2:32.697">飞</span></p><p begin="2:32.777" end="2:35.593" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.777" end="2:34.100">坏话总要听进去</span> <span begin="2:34.100" end="2:35.593">我晓得你是聪明的</span></p></div><div begin="2:35.603" end="2:48.052" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:35.603" end="2:38.583" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.603" end="2:36.723">有时在夜里不</span><span begin="2:36.723" end="2:36.928">安</span> <span begin="2:37.104" end="2:38.222">有些梦太过不</span><span begin="2:38.222" end="2:38.583">堪</span></p><p begin="2:38.593" end="2:41.589" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:38.593" end="2:39.727">多一点忍耐思</span><span begin="2:39.727" end="2:39.950">考</span> <span begin="2:40.057" end="2:41.214">少一点心有不</span><span begin="2:41.214" end="2:41.589">甘</span></p><p begin="2:41.767" end="2:44.562" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:41.767" end="2:42.832">当我过滤我的</span><span begin="2:42.832" end="2:43.275">恨</span> <span begin="2:43.627" end="2:44.562">留下更多爱</span></p><p begin="2:44.572" end="2:48.052" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.572" end="2:46.422">丛林头肉被都我抢完了</span> <span begin="2:46.422" end="2:47.383">发现我爱吃</span><span begin="2:47.383" end="2:48.052">菜</span></p></div><div begin="2:47.564" end="2:59.776" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:47.564" end="2:50.682" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:47.564" end="2:48.163">我不是</span><span begin="2:48.163" end="2:49.673">你想象中那种说唱</span><span begin="2:49.673" end="2:49.956">歌</span><span begin="2:49.956" end="2:50.682">手</span></p><p begin="2:50.692" end="2:53.625" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:50.692" end="2:50.940">说</span><span begin="2:50.940" end="2:51.169">唱</span><span begin="2:51.169" end="2:51.882">歌手</span><span begin="2:51.882" end="2:53.374">看到老子全都绕起</span><span begin="2:53.374" end="2:53.625">走</span></p><p begin="2:53.695" end="2:56.474" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:53.695" end="2:54.547">像我这种</span><span begin="2:54.547" end="2:55.192">杂皮</span> <span begin="2:55.457" end="2:55.945">不可能</span><span begin="2:55.945" end="2:56.265">受</span><span begin="2:56.265" end="2:56.474">气</span></p><p begin="2:56.484" end="2:59.776" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:56.484" end="2:57.897">世界只会告诉你</span> <span begin="2:57.897" end="2:58.471">哪个是</span><span begin="2:58.471" end="2:58.717">哥</span> <span begin="2:58.862" end="2:59.394">哪个是</span><span begin="2:59.394" end="2:59.776">弟</span></p></div><div begin="2:59.781" end="3:11.624" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:59.781" end="3:02.575" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:59.781" end="3:00.548">人这一辈</span><span begin="3:00.548" end="3:00.907">子</span> <span begin="3:00.907" end="3:02.010">你说到底图个</span><span begin="3:02.010" end="3:02.272">啥</span><span begin="3:02.272" end="3:02.575">子</span></p><p begin="3:02.585" end="3:05.573" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:02.585" end="3:03.865">是价值大于生命</span> <span begin="3:03.865" end="3:04.996">还是生命大于</span><span begin="3:04.996" end="3:05.269">价</span><span begin="3:05.269" end="3:05.573">值</span></p><p begin="3:05.583" end="3:08.421" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:05.583" end="3:06.700">曾经的苦海无</span><span begin="3:06.700" end="3:06.972">边</span> <span begin="3:07.083" end="3:08.212">追溯到往事如</span><span begin="3:08.212" end="3:08.421">烟</span></p><p begin="3:08.601" end="3:11.624" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.601" end="3:10.296">人到中年要注意健康</span> <span begin="3:10.296" end="3:11.051">莫再槟榔</span><span begin="3:11.051" end="3:11.317">配</span><span begin="3:11.317" end="3:11.624">烟</span></p></div><div begin="3:36.819" end="4:00.590" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="3:36.819" end="3:39.148" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:36.819" end="3:37.663">阳光正在</span><span begin="3:37.663" end="3:38.399">照着</span><span begin="3:38.399" end="3:39.148">我</span></p><p begin="3:39.151" end="3:42.011" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:39.151" end="3:39.875">微风也在</span><span begin="3:39.875" end="3:40.651">吹着</span><span begin="3:40.651" end="3:42.011">我</span></p><p begin="3:42.839" end="3:44.793" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:42.839" end="3:43.646">难过的话</span><span begin="3:43.646" end="3:44.332">就别</span><span begin="3:44.332" end="3:44.793">说</span></p><p begin="3:44.802" end="3:48.563" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:44.802" end="3:45.166">因为</span><span begin="3:45.166" end="3:45.543">好</span><span begin="3:45.543" end="3:45.731">多</span><span begin="3:45.731" end="3:46.114">事</span><span begin="3:46.114" end="3:46.478">情</span><span begin="3:46.478" end="3:46.711">我</span><span begin="3:46.711" end="3:47.028">已</span><span begin="3:47.028" end="3:47.203">经</span><span begin="3:47.203" end="3:47.621">想</span><span begin="3:47.621" end="3:48.563">通</span></p><p begin="3:48.860" end="3:51.058" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:48.860" end="3:49.689">跨过高山</span><span begin="3:49.689" end="3:50.401">和湖</span><span begin="3:50.401" end="3:51.058">泊</span></p><p begin="3:51.168" end="3:53.355" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:51.168" end="3:51.923">早就预知</span><span begin="3:51.923" end="3:52.673">的结</span><span begin="3:52.673" end="3:53.355">果</span></p><p begin="3:53.364" end="3:56.069" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:53.364" end="3:53.933">因为你</span><span begin="3:53.933" end="3:54.522">在</span> <span begin="3:54.732" end="3:55.477">我才会勇</span><span begin="3:55.477" end="3:56.069">敢</sp